         <ph class="- topic/ph " props="autonumber">Part 5124</ph> - Protection of Privacy and Freedom of Information</title>
      <body><p><b>The official AFARS regulation resides on the <xref href="https://armyeitaas.sharepoint-mil.us/sites/ASA-ALT-PAM-PP/SitePages/AFARS.aspx" format="html" scope="external">Army’s Knowledge Management Portal PAM</xref>.  If you do not have CAC access to PAM, please visit the Army Contracting Enterprise’s public facing website “Army Connect” at <xref href="https://www.army.mil/armycontracting#org-afars" scope="external" format="html">https://www.army.mil/armycontracting#org-afars</xref>.  The AFARS will return to Acquisition.gov upon completion of the RFO.</b></p>
         <p>
            <i>(Revised 01 October 2024)</i>
